        "claim": "Classifying modern slavery as an immigration issue weakens law enforcement's ability to pursue offenders.",
        "evidence_id": "E21",
        "quote": "The focus on classifying modern slavery as an immigration issue, rather than a serious economic crime, weakens law enforcement's ability to pursue offenders"
      },
      {
        "tier": "projected",
        "claim": "Reversing modern slavery rollbacks would restore support periods and encourage more victims to seek help.",
