        "evidence_id": "E22",
        "quote": "Reversing these changes would likely lead to better cooperation from survivors, which is crucial for successful prosecutions, and enable a more effective focus on dismantling criminal networks"
      },
      {
        "tier": "projected",
        "claim": "Local authorities face capacity and budget pressures that would need addressing for the transfer to succeed.",
        "evidence_id": "E37",
        "quote": "Local authorities already face immense budget pressures"
